	(text "PDWN: firmware holds low >= 10 ms after power-up, then high.\nR3 keeps the ADC off while the MSP is in reset / BSL.\nSPEED low = 10 SPS, CLKIN low = internal oscillator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.24 120.65 0)
